{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">美银：互联网电商前沿AI数据追踪-模型排名、用量与tokenGPU成本</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">9月中旬的这份<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>前沿AI追踪报告，把模型能力、调用量、token价格和GPU租金放在同一张表里看，主线其实只有一条：前沿模型的智能差距在收窄，但用量和花费的分布正在快速重排。先看最直观的数字，Artificial Analysis的智能指数上，Anthropic的Claude Fable 5.1与OpenAI的GPT-6 Astra同为53分并列第一，Meta的MuseSpark 1.3以48分排到第五，Gemini 3.8 Flash以41分落到第12位。能力榜头部咬得很紧，后面几位差距也不大，这决定了竞争焦点正从“谁更聪明”转向“谁更便宜、谁被更多开发者调用”。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXtDPL5LZMtL3NQ4LwRbb0K3ToMGKcApAU6M38dpQxJx2icEKS823XHd4u2sHeJKCUBPPT5g6P5UhDSbCwLN6aIMvWccYOlJ084/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV3pmgotP0AlibeeJI5hSNOTficPz9UiaPlxTStJZfgslHlp4G2YsUwKbystxia7ia9ial13LuMoQE9zB7laBgU4nHl0LWkvgLCoiaibq8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVKlpcD7cx84PMyKUvv9ZBhguV6CabBngdmnxmF1ZU4ibibAd15NobXGWicnaOxD1p7lj0pibDv35jssVQeYMUia1D9L2mGlWkrQSWY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<section style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#737D8C;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">——人工智能免责声明（部分内容由人工智能工具辅助生成）</p><p style=\"margin:0\">撰稿：Leo<br>责编：KC<br>排版：胡桃</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVbSIpdDJQ9dn1S0txxp90bd6a6ut3p82REuk1j6WZFo8UnhzQiccO9H6Tjt4iapfwjvJmR0v6wiae6Y6GEdKe1cdJYctAyorwegY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC桌面\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 11-BofA-Internet e-Commerce BofA Frontier AI Data Tracker- Model rankings- usage data- and token GPU costs-260915</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
